{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang='en'>
<head>
  <meta charset='utf-8'>
  <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Integrative, whole-person care</title>
  <meta name='description' content='A modern, holistic practice combining evidence-informed therapies and lifestyle guidance to support balance and resilience.'>
  <link rel='stylesheet' href='assets/css/styles.css'>
  <script defer src='assets/js/main.js'></script>
</head>
<body>
  <div class='page-bg'>
    <div class='pattern' aria-hidden></div>
  </div>
  <header class='site-header'>
    <div class='container'>
      <a class='brand' href='index.html'>
        <div class='logo-mark' aria-hidden></div>
        <div class='brand-text'>
          <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
          <small class='tag'>{{TAGLINE}}</small>
        </div>
      </a>
      <nav class='main-nav'>
        <ul>
          <li><a href='services.html'>Offerings</a></li>
          <li><a href='conditions.html'>Conditions</a></li>
          <li><a href='approach.html'>Our Way</a></li>
          <li><a href='pricing.html'>Investment</a></li>
          <li><a href='about.html'>Who we are</a></li>
          <li><a href='book.html'>Book a Visit</a></li>
          <li><a href='contact.html'>Reach us</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <div class='header-cta'>
        <a class='phone' href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class='hero glass-card' id='hero'>
      <div class='container hero-grid'>
        <div class='hero-copy'>
          <h1>Whole-person care that meets you where you are</h1>
          <p class='lead'>Blending traditional wisdom with modern testing and lifestyle medicine to support sustainable wellbeing — mind, body, and environment.</p>
          <div class='hero-actions'>
            <a href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' id='primary-cta' class='btn primary' data-label='{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            <a href='contact.html' class='btn ghost'>Learn more</a>
          </div>
          <p class='small'>Telehealth and in-person visits in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Practitioner: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</p>
        </div>
        <div class='hero-ripple' aria-hidden>
          <svg viewBox='0 0 400 300' preserveAspectRatio='xMidYMid slice' class='hero-art'>
            <defs>
              <linearGradient id='g1' x1='0' x2='1'>
                <stop offset='0' stop-color='#7BE1C7' stop-opacity='0.9'/>
                <stop offset='1' stop-color='#8DA4FF' stop-opacity='0.8'/>
              </linearGradient>
            </defs>
            <g fill='url(#g1)'>
              <circle cx='80' cy='60' r='60' opacity='0.28'></circle>
              <circle cx='320' cy='160' r='90' opacity='0.22'></circle>
              <ellipse cx='200' cy='220' rx='160' ry='40' opacity='0.18'></ellipse>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MYTH VS TRUTH -->
    <section class='myth-truth container'>
      <h2>Separating stories from science</h2>
      <p class='intro'>Holistic care is often misunderstood. Below are common myths and what we focus on instead.</p>
      <div class='cards'>
        <div class='card'>
          <h3>Myth: Natural means safe and instant</h3>
          <p class='truth'><strong>Truth:</strong> We consider safety, interactions, and gradual change. 'Natural' supports the body, but results are often incremental and individual.</p>
        </div>
        <div class='card'>
          <h3>Myth: Holistic care promises cures</h3>
          <p class='truth'><strong>Truth:</strong> We do not promise cures. Our goal is education, symptom management, and improved function through personalized plans.</p>
        </div>
        <div class='card'>
          <h3>Myth: It's only about supplements</h3>
          <p class='truth'><strong>Truth:</strong> Nutrition and herbs can be tools, but we emphasize sleep, stress resilience, movement, and environment as core levers.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- PILLARS -->
    <section class='pillars glass-card'>
      <div class='container'>
        <h2>Foundational pillars of care</h2>
        <p class='intro'>Our approach centers on five interrelated domains that shape health over time.</p>
        <ul class='pillar-list'>
          <li>
            <strong>Mind</strong>
            <p>Stress patterns, sleep hygiene, cognition and mood support through behavioral tools and gentle therapies.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Nutrition</strong>
            <p>Food as medicine: individualized eating strategies, timing, and targeted micronutrient support when appropriate.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Movement</strong>
            <p>Functional movement, breathwork, and practices that restore mobility and resilience without injury.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Environment</strong>
            <p>Sleep environment, toxin minimization, and practices that reduce inflammatory exposures.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Connection</strong>
            <p>Community, purpose, and relational health — often overlooked but central to lasting change.</p>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CASE NOTES -->
    <section class='case-notes container'>
      <h2>Illustrative case notes</h2>
      <p class='intro'>Short, anonymized snapshots that show the process rather than outcome guarantees.</p>
      <div class='cases'>
        <article class='case'>
          <h3>Stress & Sleep disturbance</h3>
          <p class='case-summary'>A mid-40s client with long-term insomnia. We began with sleep hygiene, gentle CBT tools, breath-based nervous system work, and targeted labs to rule out thyroid or iron issues. Follow-ups focused on pacing and gradual exposure to activity.</p>
        </article>
        <article class='case'>
          <h3>Digestive imbalance</h3>
          <p class='case-summary'>Someone with bloating and inconsistent bowel habits. After a careful diet review and stool testing education, we introduced diet changes, pre/probiotic strategies, and an elimination trial with monitoring.</p>
        </article>
        <article class='case'>
          <h3>Chronic inflammation & low energy</h3>
          <p class='case-summary'>Approach combined movement, anti-inflammatory dietary patterns, sleep optimization, and optional lab assessment to inform targeted supplements if needed.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p class='disclaimer'>These are educational examples, not promises. Individual care is personalized and may include referrals and evidence-based testing.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <section class='faq glass-card container'>
      <h2>Questions we often hear</h2>
      <div class='accordion'>
        <div class='item'>
          <button class='q'>How do visits typically work?<span class='plus'>+</span></button>
          <div class='a'>Initial intake is thorough: health history, goals, basic exam remotely or in-person, and shared decision-making for next steps.</div>
        </div>
        <div class='item'>
          <button class='q'>Do you use lab testing?<span class='plus'>+</span></button>
          <div class='a'>We may recommend educational, evidence-informed labs as optional tools to clarify the picture. Testing is chosen to add value and is explained fully.</div>
        </div>
        <div class='item'>
          <button class='q'>Will I need supplements?<span class='plus'>+</span></button>
          <div class='a'>Supplements can help in selected situations but are not always required. We prioritize low-risk, evidence-aligned options and discuss interactions.</div>
        </div>
        <div class='item'>
          <button class='q'>Do you guarantee results?<span class='plus'>+</span></button>
          <div class='a'>No. We never promise cures. The aim is to clarify drivers, reduce symptoms when possible, and support sustainable improvements through education and partnership.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class='final-cta container'>
      <div class='cta-card glass-card'>
        <h2>Ready to start a thoughtful plan?</h2>
        <p>Schedule a consult to discuss your priorities, review options, and build a stepwise plan tailored to you.</p>
        <div class='cta-actions'>
          <a href='{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}' class='btn primary large ripple' id='book-top'>{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a href='contact.html' class='btn ghost'>Contact team</a>
        </div>
        <p class='tiny'>Phone: <a href='tel:{{PHONE}}'>{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href='mailto:{{EMAIL}}'>{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer class='site-footer'>
    <div class='container footer-grid'>
      <div>
        <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
        <p class='muted'>{{TAGLINE}}</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <nav>
          <ul>
            <li><a href='services.html'>Services</a></li>
            <li><a href='about.html'>Team</a></li>
            <li><a href='book.html'>Book</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Serving <span>{{CITY}}</span>, <span>{{STATE}}</span></p>
        <p class='tiny'>Licensed provider: {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}}</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class='copyright'>© <span id='year'></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
"}
